{
  "title": "Tokenizer Analysis for English-Hindi Legal Text",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Byte Fallback Analysis",
      "finding": "GPT-4o/cl100k tokenizer has only merged 13% of Devanagari characters (128 total) into single tokens. The remaining 87% are encoded as 2-3 byte-level tokens each. This is because Devanagari characters are rare in the training data and the BPE merge algorithm never learned to merge their UTF-8 byte sequences.",
